
requires: a C17 compiler, CMake, and BlueZ development headers on Linux

configure:
$ cmake -S . -B build \
    -DTFKISS_ENABLE_HIBAUD=ON \
    -DTFKISS_ENABLE_XPID=ON \
    -DTFKISS_ENABLE_AXIP=ON

build:
$ cmake --build build
$ ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

debug build:
$ cmake -S . -B build-debug -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug \
    -DTFKISS_ENABLE_HIBAUD=ON \
    -DTFKISS_ENABLE_XPID=ON \
    -DTFKISS_ENABLE_AXIP=ON
$ cmake --build build-debug


73 de Thomas, HB9XAR


